# Fuzzer finding: the cut removed a wrong rectangle, half the area.
sheet 1 1 0.4
plate base 0 0 50 40 origin 0 0 0 axes +x +y
flange f0 base +x 30 30
flange f1 f0 +y 90 30
cut 53.4904 19.4904 57.4904 23.4904 along y
